WEBVTT

00:00:01.140 --> 00:00:03.790
Um, when you're watching television...

00:00:03.790 --> 00:00:06.670
...please keep the room well-lit,
and don't sit too close to the screen.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.390
Today's going to be fun! La-la-la...

00:00:11.390 --> 00:00:14.870
It's Sunday! La-la-la...

00:00:14.870 --> 00:00:18.410
Today will be my first date...

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:20.990
...with my husband!

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:23.760
We're gonna see a show together! La-la-la...

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:25.830
Good morning, Rizel-chan!

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:30.240
Good morning, Aoi-chan! You're here early!

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:35.380
Why are you so carefree?! Is Iwaki-kun
actually going on a date with Kyouko-san?!

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:37.650
Yeah, that's what he said last night.

00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:39.220
And you're okay with that?!

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.430
It'll be fun with all three of us there, right? A group date!

00:00:42.430 --> 00:00:44.100
You're planning to go <i>with</i>  them?!

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:48.310
Why of course! Because I'm his wife,
and Kyouko-san is #2!

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:51.910
Aoi-chan, do you mind being #3?
Or maybe his #Gamma?

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:54.270
I see you've been reading
strange library books again.

00:00:54.270 --> 00:00:56.180
No, it was a book here at home!

00:00:56.180 --> 00:00:58.700
Never mind that; Iwaki-kun's already left!

00:00:59.180 --> 00:01:01.540
I saw him heading towards the station earlier!

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:04.280
Ehh?! You're so impatient, Darling!

00:01:06.180 --> 00:01:10.080
Okay, let's chase him down! Go!

00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:12.050
Wait, Rizel-chan!

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:47.150
By Force?! Five Seconds Before Union!

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:55.260
I wonder if Iwaki-kun will show up.

00:02:58.020 --> 00:03:00.430
Iwaki-kun, can't you be happy too?

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:08.460
I'm here.

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:10.760
No way! I don't believe it...

00:03:10.760 --> 00:03:12.320
W-Why are you crying?

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:14.880
I'm sorry. I'm just so happy!

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:15.900
Here.

00:03:17.740 --> 00:03:19.160
Thank you!

00:03:20.390 --> 00:03:21.910
C-Come on, dry them up...

00:03:21.910 --> 00:03:23.110
Okay.

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:28.120
Why am I so nervous?

00:03:34.330 --> 00:03:36.530
I'll return this to you after I wash it.

00:03:36.530 --> 00:03:39.220
Don't worry about it.
Let's just go buy our tickets.

00:03:39.220 --> 00:03:40.680
Um...!

00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:42.680
Um... well...

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:47.530
There's something stuck on your glasses.

00:03:54.240 --> 00:03:56.310
Wouldn't it be faster to just take them off?

00:03:56.310 --> 00:03:58.660
N-No, I mustn't take these off.

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:01.480
Ah, well... let's get going!

00:04:02.920 --> 00:04:04.330
Are you okay?

00:04:04.330 --> 00:04:07.640
I'm sorry, I...

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:09.250
Come on.

00:04:12.300 --> 00:04:13.500
Oh no...

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:22.560
Yahoo!!

00:04:22.560 --> 00:04:24.680
This thing is amazing!

00:04:24.680 --> 00:04:25.680
Yeah!

00:04:26.090 --> 00:04:29.100
Still, I hope we can make it on time
for the afternoon show...

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:34.530
From what I read in the guidebook, it should be fun for all of us.

00:04:34.530 --> 00:04:36.340
You really don't get it, do you...

00:04:36.340 --> 00:04:37.700
SPEED UP!!!

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:53.130
Argh! The train Tomonori-kun got on has already left!

00:04:53.130 --> 00:04:54.500
Hurry up, Rizel!

00:04:54.500 --> 00:04:57.600
With the power of your vehicle, you can make it to the next station and meet up with him there.

00:04:57.600 --> 00:05:01.350
Argh! But Rizel already went
straight into the first station!

00:05:01.350 --> 00:05:04.530
We should use the police hotline to contact Rizel!

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:06.440
WHY?!?

00:05:06.440 --> 00:05:07.520
I DON'T KNOW!!!

00:05:14.940 --> 00:05:15.900
Yeah, yeah...

00:05:18.480 --> 00:05:19.700
Hello, Iwaki residence...

00:05:19.700 --> 00:05:22.280
Let us activate Project R-2!

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:25.200
I see. Yes. Thank you very much.

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:27.020
Well then, goodbye.

00:05:28.350 --> 00:05:29.760
Old Man.

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:30.960
Yes, young master?

00:05:30.960 --> 00:05:31.860
We're going out.

00:05:31.860 --> 00:05:32.850
Where to?

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:34.710
To the Toshiuen Amusement Park.

00:05:35.260 --> 00:05:37.550
My dear maiden is headed there!

00:05:37.550 --> 00:05:40.630
It is my duty to ensure her happiness!

00:05:41.710 --> 00:05:43.600
Wah! Wait, wait!!

00:05:43.600 --> 00:05:45.250
We're getting on!

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:50.600
Eh? Why's it empty?

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:52.910
Yay! Car to ourselves!

00:05:53.530 --> 00:05:56.110
Mwahahaha... R-2...

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:10.040
Iwaki-kun, where are you? Iwaki-kun?

00:06:13.060 --> 00:06:16.370
It's me, it's me. Sorry, I walk kinda fast.

00:06:16.370 --> 00:06:20.630
No! C-Can I hold... your hand?

00:06:22.850 --> 00:06:25.530
I-I'm sorry! I just thought I'd try saying it.

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:27.990
Oh, no, I was just...

00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:30.980
Anyway, let's hurry on along.

00:06:35.230 --> 00:06:36.970
Are you all right?

00:06:36.970 --> 00:06:38.150
Uh... yeah...

00:06:41.240 --> 00:06:44.290
We now have exceptionally detailed data on the young woman who is with him...

00:06:44.290 --> 00:06:46.950
Egads! This is no ordinary girl!

00:06:46.950 --> 00:06:51.230
She's so strong, she was selected as a power-lifting representative for...

00:06:51.230 --> 00:06:52.170
Power-lifting?

00:06:52.170 --> 00:06:53.420
What about it?

00:06:53.420 --> 00:06:55.310
It couldn't be...

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:56.500
This is...!

00:06:56.500 --> 00:06:57.510
No way!

00:06:57.510 --> 00:07:00.920
Excuse me. I have something else
to attend to. See ya!

00:07:06.470 --> 00:07:08.650
Just his type, a big-breasted girl in glasses...

00:07:09.920 --> 00:07:12.690
He must have sensed something, right?

00:07:12.690 --> 00:07:14.410
I don't know.
We'll have to trust in his...

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:17.460
...profound, expert knowledge of
young middle- and high-school girls.

00:07:17.460 --> 00:07:18.320
Yes.

00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:26.490
I'm so happy...

00:07:27.230 --> 00:07:29.210
...that I could be in a picture like this.

00:07:29.520 --> 00:07:31.300
Um... Iwaki-kun?

00:07:32.020 --> 00:07:33.900
Er... well...

00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:35.080
Go ahead and go.

00:07:35.490 --> 00:07:36.460
The bathroom, right?

00:07:36.460 --> 00:07:38.150
Ah... y-yes.

00:07:42.220 --> 00:07:45.430
This really isn't so bad.

00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:48.300
Stupid me!

00:07:49.930 --> 00:07:53.550
I've got a sinking suspicion that we won't make it in time...

00:07:53.550 --> 00:07:54.730
You're right.

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:56.390
You finally understand it?

00:07:56.390 --> 00:07:59.830
Because today's the last day
of the afternoon show!

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:01.570
No, that's not what I mean.

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:05.480
What a strange station!

00:08:05.990 --> 00:08:07.980
How'd we wind up here?

00:08:11.650 --> 00:08:13.510
We took the new tracks,

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:16.580
but construction on them was apparently suspended due to community opposition.

00:08:16.580 --> 00:08:18.630
The line was never completed!

00:08:18.630 --> 00:08:21.480
It would take about an hour to go back,

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:25.130
and even if we resumed construction via Power of the State, it would take 2 or 3 days to get it done.

00:08:25.130 --> 00:08:26.380
We're sorry, Rizel!

00:08:26.380 --> 00:08:29.050
We're not gonna make it to the afternoon show!

00:08:29.050 --> 00:08:31.190
What IS this train, anyway?

00:08:31.190 --> 00:08:33.640
Aoi-chan, I'm going on ahead!

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:43.590
Save me, Darling!

00:08:46.770 --> 00:08:48.990
I trust you are not injured, my dear maiden?

00:08:48.990 --> 00:08:52.290
Thank you! Would you mind taking me
to the amusement park?

00:08:52.290 --> 00:08:54.660
Yes! That was my intention in the first place!

00:08:58.370 --> 00:09:00.790
Young master, I pray for your success.

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:03.570
This is pretty good!

00:09:04.080 --> 00:09:06.550
Ah! There's a bit stuck on your nose.

00:09:09.320 --> 00:09:11.100
L-Let's go ride that one!

00:09:14.440 --> 00:09:16.870
Wow! Amazing!

00:09:16.870 --> 00:09:19.890
It looks like this'll get me to the afternoon show in time!

00:09:19.890 --> 00:09:23.170
Thank you so much, Honmou Hanbaiin-kun!

00:09:23.170 --> 00:09:25.360
It's Hououin, my dear maiden.

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:32.490
This... really isn't bad at all...

00:09:35.760 --> 00:09:39.140
What should I do?
I'm all alone with Iwaki-kun.

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:43.280
If I don't go for it now, I'll probably never be able to give him the present...

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:48.490
But... I can't do it! Ohh, what should I do?

00:09:48.960 --> 00:09:53.160
What should I do? Help me, my other self!

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:56.220
No, no more... I can't take it anymore!

00:09:56.220 --> 00:09:58.670
Um, er, you know...

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:02.400
W-What's wrong?

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:16.130
Say, Tomonori... did you know
that it takes 20 minutes

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:18.480
for this Ferris wheel to make a full cycle?

00:10:18.910 --> 00:10:21.900
20 minutes is enough time
for us to do <i>all</i>  sorts of things...

00:10:21.900 --> 00:10:23.130
Er, well, that-

00:10:23.130 --> 00:10:24.820
Like <i>this,</i> for example...

00:10:24.820 --> 00:10:26.340
W-What are you doing??

00:10:28.460 --> 00:10:31.350
I've been waiting two whole years for this...

00:10:31.350 --> 00:10:35.080
What's gotten into you?! It's like you've
instantly become a totally different person!

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:38.800
No, I'm still all me.

00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:41.510
S-Stop it!!

00:10:42.380 --> 00:10:46.310
That's my husband! Wait! Stop this kite!

00:10:46.310 --> 00:10:49.070
I won't be stopping it.
Come, let us continue on together.

00:10:49.070 --> 00:10:51.650
Besides, if that car is rocking, we should not be knocking.

00:10:51.650 --> 00:10:53.290
D-Darling!!

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:55.820
Ah! My dear maiden!
D-Darling!!

00:10:56.410 --> 00:10:59.130
Rizel! W-What are you doing here, Rizel?!

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:00.400
Before we get interrupted...

00:11:00.400 --> 00:11:02.410
NOOO!!

00:11:02.780 --> 00:11:04.250
R-Rizel!!

00:11:06.740 --> 00:11:08.550
Aww, it's gotten so big...!

00:11:08.550 --> 00:11:11.170
It might be a bit tight, but just hold still...

00:11:11.170 --> 00:11:14.230
C-Cut it out! Stop it, I said!!

00:11:16.330 --> 00:11:18.270
It's just as I feared!

00:11:18.270 --> 00:11:21.180
NOOO~!!!

00:11:21.180 --> 00:11:23.140
Hold it right there, Kyouko!!

00:11:32.930 --> 00:11:34.680
I...!

00:11:34.680 --> 00:11:36.310
You're back to normal?

00:11:36.310 --> 00:11:39.590
I'm sorry! I have this strange condition.

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:42.870
Normally I wear special glasses to keep it under control,

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:44.370
but my courage failed me, and then...

00:11:44.790 --> 00:11:49.350
I just wanted to give you this present today
and have you wear it.

00:11:49.350 --> 00:11:50.340
What the heck is that?

00:11:50.630 --> 00:11:53.440
A thank-you gift.

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:57.100
That morning two years ago,
the seat of your pants got ripped.

00:11:57.460 --> 00:11:59.910
I've felt bad about it for a long time.

00:11:59.910 --> 00:12:01.620
Since they're the "middle-school" type,

00:12:01.620 --> 00:12:04.810
I figured it'd be pointless to give them to you after you'd graduated.

00:12:04.810 --> 00:12:07.120
Go ahead and wear them for her, Darling.

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:08.770
W-W-What are you talking about?!

00:12:08.770 --> 00:12:11.580
No, that's all right.
I wouldn't want to bother Iwaki-kun...

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:13.690
Don't worry about it!

00:12:14.510 --> 00:12:16.040
What the hell is this?!

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:17.020
A perfect fit!

00:12:17.020 --> 00:12:17.910
Oh, my!

00:12:18.270 --> 00:12:21.740
They're so cute! And so you!
I'm so embarrassed!

00:12:21.740 --> 00:12:23.160
Oh, my...!!

00:12:23.750 --> 00:12:26.020
All right, let's head over to the show next!

00:12:26.020 --> 00:12:27.620
Like hell I would, you idiot!

00:12:27.620 --> 00:12:30.080
Ah! Wait, Darling!

00:12:32.240 --> 00:12:33.840
It can't be...

00:14:09.750 --> 00:14:11.710
Um... I'm Yachigusa Kyouko...

00:14:11.710 --> 00:14:14.230
Eh? What are my tastes in boys?

00:14:14.230 --> 00:14:15.950
First off, they have to be younger than me...

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:17.690
The stubborn ones who
won't give in no matter what

00:14:17.690 --> 00:14:20.860
and try to put up a tough front... they're the worst.

00:14:20.860 --> 00:14:23.830
Ah, whatever shall I do?

00:14:27.100 --> 00:14:30.370
Um... I'm Yachigusa Kyouko.
Pleased to meet you.

00:14:30.370 --> 00:14:32.660
Eh? What are my tastes in boys?

00:14:32.660 --> 00:14:35.490
Well, they definitely need to be younger than me.

00:14:35.490 --> 00:14:37.450
Oh, this is embarrassing!

00:14:37.450 --> 00:14:39.900
Pretty boys aren't bad, but...

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:42.170
...then there's the troubled, rebellious type...

00:14:42.170 --> 00:14:44.450
Ah! I said it!

00:14:44.450 --> 00:14:47.130
The stubborn ones who
won't give in no matter what

00:14:47.130 --> 00:14:49.530
and try to put up a tough front...
they're the worst.

00:14:49.530 --> 00:14:52.850
Ah, whatever shall I do?
